\section*{Compilation Instructions}
To compile the publication into a fully typeset PDF, execute the standard 
four-pass LaTeX sequence:

\begin{verbatim}
pdflatex publication_500_pages.tex
bibtex publication_500_pages
pdflatex publication_500_pages.tex
pdflatex publication_500_pages.tex
\end{verbatim}

\subsection*{Compilation Notes}
\begin{itemize}
    \item First \texttt{pdflatex} pass generates auxiliary files and citation anchors.
    \item \texttt{bibtex} processes bibliography entries and citation databases.
    \item Second \texttt{pdflatex} pass resolves references and hyperlinks.
    \item Third \texttt{pdflatex} pass finalizes float placement and document structure.
\end{itemize}

\section*{Dependencies}
